.TH SINH 3
.SH NAME
sinh, cosh, tanh \- hyperbolic functions
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
#include <math.h>

double
sinh(x)
double x;

double
cosh(x)
double x;

double
tanh(x)
double x;
.fi
.PP
cc ... \-lm
.SH DESCRIPTION
These functions return the hyperbolic sine, cosine and tangent of
.IR x ,
within two units in the last place of the exact value.
.SH "RETURN VALUES"
When the result is too large,
.B sinh
returns HUGE, or \-HUGE for a negative
.IR x ,
and
.B cosh
returns HUGE.
.SH ERRORS
errno is set to ERANGE when the result is too large.
.SH SEE ALSO
exp(3), matherr(3), intro(3)
.SH HISTORY
The
.BR sinh ,
.B cosh
and
.B tanh
functions first appeared in Version 7 AT&T UNIX.
